  "aiDocs.attentionDocs.groupedQueryGqa.summary": "Groups multiple Query heads to share single Key and Value heads, slashing KV-cache memory bandwidth by up to 87% (used in Llama 3).",
  "aiDocs.attentionDocs.linearAttention.summary": "Replaces the softmax operator with kernel feature maps, decoupling matrix multiplications and reducing complexity from O(N²) to O(N).",
  "aiDocs.attentionDocs.standardMha.summary": "Projects Query, Key, and Value into multiple orthogonal subspaces to learn diverse positional and semantic interactions.",
